    "b-10-knowledge-ledger-an-append-only-ledger-of-6": {
      "id": "b-10-knowledge-ledger-an-append-only-ledger-of-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "An append-only ledger of beliefs about what functions mean — its own store with a curator-owned write path (the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "appendCuratedKnowledgeRecords",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " pattern), consumed by "
        },
        {
          "insert": "builders/learnings.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " at rebuild time, which emits "
        },
        {
          "insert": "HAS_LEARNING",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " edges and flips changed subjects to "
        },
        {
          "insert": "stale",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " via the content-hash check. It is a staging area, not a permanent store: knowledge leaves by graduating into upstream renames and comments. Beliefs regime. Exists today: no. Design rationale — the idea, drift controls, lifecycle, and traversal — is folded into this file below."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
